<title>DUBAI: Dubai get two new Mitsui port cranes.</title>
<headline>Dubai get two new Mitsui port cranes.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dubai Ports Authority (DPA) said on Wednesday it had received two new Post Panamax gantry cranes from Mitsui Engineering and Shipbuilding.</p>
<p>In a statement it said the two cranes, which have a rated load capacity of 41 tonnes, would be installed at Jebel Ali port and would be operational by January 1997.</p>
<p>They bring to 25 the number of gantry cranes at the DPA's Jebel Ali and Port Rashid harbours.</p>
</text>
